{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The available Spotify APIs can discover and follow every qualifying artist, but no public read API or response field exposes the authenticated user's followed-artist state. Consequently, the required post-mutation verification cannot be performed.","missing_public_schema_fields":["A public authenticated Spotify read API that returns followed artists, including artist_id, or an equivalent is_followed field in an existing public artist-read", "If adding a followed-artists read API, its pagination parameters or pagination metadata so every page can be verified"],"task_id":"07b42fd_1","task_family":"07b42fd","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"No compliant executable plan can be produced until the public schema supports re-reading the authenticated user's followed artists after the mutations.","steps":[]}